@startuml cpp-cli-comparison
!pragma layout smetana
title M6: two ABI transports, one managed lifetime policy
hide empty members
class "Host\nselects and owns adapter" as Host
interface "Core.IInspector" as Port {
  InspectAsync
}
class "C++/CLI CliInspector\nimplements IInspector" as Cli
class "Interop.NativeInspector\nshared managed operation lifetime" as Lifetime
interface "Interop.INativeInspectionApi" as Api {
  Create / Start / RequestStop / Wait
}
class "C# PInvokeInspectionApi\nLibraryImport / fixed" as PInvoke
class "C++/CLI CliNativeApi\npin_ptr / unmanaged thunk" as Transport
class "NativeInspection.dll\nC ABI 2 / same worker" as DLL
Host --> Port
Cli ..|> Port
Lifetime ..|> Port
Cli --> Lifetime : owns / delegates execution and disposal
Lifetime --> Api
PInvoke ..|> Api
Transport ..|> Api
PInvoke --> DLL
Transport --> DLL
note bottom of Lifetime
Task, cancellation, callback root and SafeHandle lease.
Successful Wait precedes release.
Unconfirmed Wait retains context and lease until process exit.
end note
note bottom of DLL
Start copies input.
Wait joins work and callbacks.
Destroy only after confirmed join.
end note
@enduml
